ModuleSlyCustomDesc=SLY: PDF templates (invoice, sales order, proforma, shipment, supplier PO/invoice), ShipsGo sync, Wise incoming payments (webhook reconciliation), Tools exports & Search Order, terms PDF append, hooks (multicurrency on lists/index, Shipment menu layout, product labels, order doc options, remx split discount with patch). Dolibarr 14.0 / 22.0; optional core patches per patches/APPLY-ON-22.md.
