Module500100Desc=SLY: PDF templates (invoice, sales order, proforma, shipment, supplier PO/invoice), ShipsGo cron, Tools exports & Search Order, terms PDF append, hooks (multicurrency on lists/index, Shipment menu layout, product labels, order doc options, remx split discount with patch). Dolibarr 14.0 / 22.0; optional core patches per patches/APPLY-ON-22.md.
SLYCustomSetup=SLY Custom Setup
SLYCustomDescription=About this module
SLYCustomDescriptionLong=SLY Custom bundles company-specific behaviour for Dolibarr 14.0 and 22.0: SLY PDF models (customer invoice, sales orders and proformas, shipments/packing lists, supplier orders, supplier invoices including debit note), optional ShipsGo API status sync (scheduled job), Wise incoming-payment reconciliation (balances#credit webhook, statement-based SO matching, manual confirm), SLY export pages under Tools (SO/PO/shipment/invoice detail exports and all-in-one), Search Order, replacement dashboard widgets (last actions, birthdays—multicurrency invoice boxes now use core), Rubis-style terms PDF append and order document options, and hooks across cards/lists (source order columns, multicurrency amounts on order/invoice home, Shipment under Commerce menu, product extrafield labels, supplier flows, payment lists, etc.). On 22.0 some features still need small core patches—see patches/APPLY-ON-22.md and patches/PATCHES-BY-MODULE.md.
